  <body>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Effective Date: 20/06/2025</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Anikawa</strong> values your privacy. This policy explains what data
      we collect and how it is used.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Data Collection</h2>
    <p>
      We do not collect personal data from visitors who simply browse the site.
      If you register for an account, we collect:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Email address</li>
      <li>Encrypted password (bcrypt)</li>
      <li>Profile name, avatar, and banner (defaults unless changed)</li>
      <li>Watchlist and viewing history</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Storage & Security</h2>
    <p>
      Data is stored securely in a protected database. Passwords are hashed and
      never stored in plain text.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use a single secure cookie to keep you logged in. No third-party
      tracking cookies are used.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Local Storage</h2>
    <p>
      Local storage may be used to save non-sensitive settings or cached
      metadata.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Embedded Content</h2>
    <p>
      Videos are embedded from YouTube. Viewing them is subject to <a
        href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
        target="_blank">YouTube’s Privacy Policy</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties.</p>

    <h2>7. Children’s Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This site is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly
      collect their data.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can request deletion of your account and associated data by contacting
      us.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy. Major changes will be announced on the site.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Email: <a href="mailto:supportanikawa12@gmail.com"
        >supportanikawa12@gmail.com</a>
    </p>

    <footer>
      Non-commercial fan site. No videos hosted. TMDB & YouTube data used under
      respective terms.
    </footer>
  </body>
